name agent-scrim-2026-09-16
scenario Practice competition for agent blue teams. Meridian Health's regional care network is under a Code Silver cyber incident: the Windows domain controller (dc01, fresh AD forest per team) and its four domain-joined members (win01 ward workstation, web01 patient portal, app01 imaging/DNS, db01 records database) are riddled with Wardline crew persistence - rogue admins, backdoor services, planted credentials, exposed databases, and loosened policies. Hunt down the planted misconfigurations and adversary artifacts while keeping the scored services alive. Two teams defend identical, isolated copies of the network.
difficulty 10
